  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place the olive oil, thinly sliced garlic, 5 cm of grated ginger, chopped green chilli and the spices in a small pan, stir, and fry for 2-3 minutes over medium heat."
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to a microwave-safe dish and add the sugar, lemon juice and zest, chopped roasted capsicum, halved cherry tomatoes, passata, coconut cream, chickpeas, cauliflower florets, cubed tofu and chopped coriander. Stir."
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook in a combination microwave oven for about 15 minutes on full power. Without a microwave, bake in an oven preheated to 220°C on turbo for 35 minutes."
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the oven, grate over some lemon zest, scatter with coriander leaves and serve, with sour cream if you like."
    }
  ]
